-- What the informal proofs of sag/zmt4 open, declaration by declaration
-- (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6), for the central declarations.  Each list was
-- compared with the file comment of its declaration.  Besides the notions
-- each proof is about (deh, mon, mon3, bpow, genX, genT, sel3, cfj, RedW,
-- Acts, HomDeg, filt, filtT, Lpat, Dc, sT, qk, rhs, rhsZ, ...), the lists
-- contain carriers and list/Fin structure (Fin, len, Mem, appL, mapL,
-- catL, TPoly, regular, carrier, image, mod, El, val, Raw), integer and
-- natural arithmetic of degrees (minus, plus, size, addN4, subE, cdeg),
-- the module operations of chart cochains (madd, mneg, sm, msub), and
-- 'by definition' of the families of HomogeneousMatrices4 (A, gi, lin,
-- C1, k1, fv, into, ract) where a J-witness is read pointwise.
ZMT4Certificate.Over.mon-add:
ZMT4Certificate.Over.deh-scale: deh Hom Preserves scaleT TPoly
ZMT4Certificate.Over.V.pick3H: dich ex1 ex2 ex3 g genT genX Hom mon N n1 n2 n3 nat-dec plus rangeN regular rng sel sel3 selR
ZMT4Certificate.Over.V.expand: cfj deh Hom HomDeg Preserves TPoly
ZMT4Certificate.Over.V.one: addF B' Hom HomDeg lin mulF N oneT sum toR
ZMT4Certificate.Over.V.Integral.root: backward chi choose ev evaluate extend extension Hom induction map P ring
ZMT4Certificate.Over.Data.Red.big1: HomDeg plus RedW scaleT TPoly
ZMT4Certificate.Over.Data.Red.small: d Hom HomDeg mon Preserves RedW scaleT TPoly
ZMT4Certificate.Over.Data.Red.res:
ZMT4Certificate.Over.Data.certificate:
ZMT4Setup.Over.deh-pmul: addQ app Carrier choose deh E Hom image include induction map operation pmul Q ring scaleT TPoly zeroQ
ZMT4Setup.Over.deh-tl: addQ algebra app choose constant E eval generators Hom include inclusion induction iota map mon mulQ operation pmul ring tl TPoly y
ZMT4Setup.Over.deh-f: algebra Carrier E eqs ev Ex fT generators image Q ring solution Solutions y
ZMT4Setup.Over.deh-homT: addQ AllLe app Carrier choose deh dich E Hom homT homTerm image induction map operation Q ring size TPoly
ZMT4Setup.Over.deh-P: AllLe app Carrier e E fT image mexpr P powE Q res ring tl
ZMT4Polynomials.filt-mem: decOut filt filtStep Mem
ZMT4Polynomials.dom-pat:
ZMT4Polynomials.Over.ChartPoly.g-neg: addE g none Not Out S' subE
ZMT4Polynomials.Over.ChartPoly.rep:
ZMT4Polynomials.Over.cf-filt: cf filtT keepT mulP nat-dec size TPoly
ZMT4Polynomials.Deh.deh-expand: coef deh exps Hom Mem Preserves regular TPoly
ZMT4Polynomials.Deh.deh-cf: Hom
ZMT4Extract.Over.HP.cf-T:
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.W.hJ: A app comp E El fT fv gi homT incl into JW lin mexpr MJ mod mulP P powE ract Raw regular res sum three tl val Yv
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.W.L.Edge.cf-J: g Raw regular TY Yv
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.W.L.Edge.cf-id: app cf-rep filt filtT mapL nub poly qk Raw rep rhs S' scaleT sT T tl TPoly
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.W.L.Edge.dl: app Carrier cf-rep E filt filtT image L0 mapL mon nub poly Q rep rhs ring s S' scaleT sT T tl TPoly
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.W.L.cf-Z: app cf fT g homT L0 mexpr mulP O P pmul powE psum Raw regular res rhsZ sT three tl TPoly TY' XS YS Yv'
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.W.L.cong: app Carrier Certificate comb E fT Hom homT image lin mexpr mon O P pmul powE Preserves psum Q res rhsZ ring s sum three tl TPoly vj XS YS
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.W.L.certificate: E
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.W.cert: C1 carrier El IJW image JW MJ mod Raw Supp SXs SY's SYs SZ three Yv Yv' ZT
ZMT4Extract.Over.Sec.extract: carrier E El IJ image InJ mod ZT
ZMT4Assembly.Over.Inputs.certificate: Corrected d ZT
ZMT4Regression.Point.certificate:
ZMT4Regression.Point.deg-one: addF B' d mulF N P plus toR
